 "title": "Room 1.1 · 3 Mastiffs (CR 1/8 each) · Moderate, 75 XP · cleared, untouched",
 "headline": "Morten cleared the first room without taking a scratch. Sleep caught all three dogs at the door, and Thunderwave (rerolled with Heroic Inspiration) and two Shocking Grasps finished them.",
 "prose": [],
 "bullets": [
  {
   "label": "The room",
   "text": "6×8 sq (9×12 m), knee-deep water across the floor (difficult terrain). The owl saw three Mastiffs at the far end, and their noses found him at once."
  },
  {
   "label": "The plan",
   "text": "Morten waited one square outside the door, so only one dog at a time could reach him. The water halved their speed, and they had to Dash just to reach the doorway, which left them bunched for Sleep."
  },
  {
   "label": "Cheese",
   "text": "Sleep on the pack as it piled up at the door. All three failed the first save. On the second, only Mastiff B fell asleep, but that still bought him the round he needed."
  },
  {
   "label": "The dice",
   "text": "Thunderwave fizzled on a natural 2. He spent his Heroic Inspiration on the reroll, which came up 18 (23 vs DC 11), so the spell isn't lost. The 2d8 rolled only 5 dmg: enough to kill the sleeping dog and leave the other two on 3 HP each. Neither dog's bite came close (13 and 6 vs AC 15)."
  },
  {
   "label": "Result",
   "text": "20/20 HP, nothing lost, Heroic Inspiration spent. XP 900 → 975. +7 GP from a collar pouch."
  }
 ],
